      <p>The following secrets management Operators can be managed with External Secrets Management Console Plug-in:</p>
      <ul>
      <li>External Secrets Operator for Red Hat OpenShift</li>
      <li>cert-manager Operator for Red Hat OpenShift</li>
      <li>Secrets Store CSI Driver Operator</li>
      </ul>
      <p>You can use the plug-in to complete the following tasks:</p>
      <ul>
      <li>View and filter secrets-related CRs from all installed secrets management Operators in a unified dashboard.</li>
